<title>AUSTRALIA: Quiet trade in Australia's SFE wheat futures.</title>
<headline>Quiet trade in Australia's SFE wheat futures.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in Sydney Futures Exchange (SFE) wheat futures was quiet on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The only contract to trade, January 1998, edged up 50 cents to A$166.50 a tonne on a volume of just two lots.</p>
<p>Settlement prices for the other contracts were mostly unchanged.</p>
